  - FY2025 cash includes 6mm restricted cash (ties to the cash flow statement); other current assets reduced to match
  - No usable segment disclosure in XBRL: modelled as one segment (segment profit = operating income + intangible amortization + stock comp + other operating expense such as acquired IPR&D, impairments and restructuring, which sit in 'non-segment charges')
  - 2026E buybacks raised to the 10,782mm already made year to date
  - 2026E acquisitions raised to the 586mm already made year to date
